{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1238457,\"title\":\"To: Agnès, With Love\",\"tagline\":\"A short film about love, loss and the importance of family\",\"overview\":\"After a lifetime together, Arthur has to deal with the loss of his wife. However, his ways of coping start affecting his relationship with whom he has left.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wTAF0LcP2I0L1DBqk3sigwevuRT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2024,\"runtime\":9,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Sophia Sampaio Silva\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4509693,\"name\":\"Sophia Sampaio Silva\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":183212,\"name\":\"Gregory Cox\",\"character\":\"Arthur\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8OZGWPrFMUL4ceacDczEsRiPsKz.jpg\"},{\"id\":4509692,\"name\":\"Tom Briggs\",\"character\":\"Michael\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1088548,\"title\":\"Bitter Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kiPGcHX0YT49nrab76G0bqw3gHW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ppLv2F7dhvI3wxaEoOP1E0OyBPP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a long December holiday weekend, a woman, whose mother has recently died, throws herself into work as a form of escape. Her relentless pace is interrupted when a panic attack forces her to take a break.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":420818,\"title\":\"The Lion King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dzBtMocZuJbjLOXvrl4zGYigDzh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TUg5pO1VZ4B0Q1amk3OlXvlpXV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Simba idolizes his father, King Mufasa, and takes to heart his own royal destiny. But not everyone in the kingdom celebrates the new cub's arrival. Scar, Mufasa's brother—and former heir to the throne—has plans of his own. The battle for Pride Rock is ravaged with betrayal, tragedy and drama, ultimately resulting in Simba's exile. With help from a curious pair of newfound friends, Simba will have to figure out how to grow up and take back what is rightfully his.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1316092,\"title\":\"“Wuthering Heights”\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ywRO5dyE8RyyXJd6cvd69jLZeic.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2KArIXEUQbLuCYPnvPfQAZqnHpg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Tragedy strikes when Heathcliff falls in love with Catherine Earnshaw, a woman from a wealthy family in 18th-century England.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":334541,\"title\":\"Manchester by the Sea\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o9VXYOuaJxCEKOxbA86xqtwmqYn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fjk4eE8Ypke4YLv5A3ArDH4GzYH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his older brother passes away, Lee Chandler is forced to return home to care for his 16-year-old nephew. There he is compelled to deal with a tragic past that separated him from his family and the community where he was born and raised.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":858024,\"title\":\"Hamnet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vbeyOZm2bvBXcbgPD3v6o94epPX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/73BClq9FOcrWrutnpiqhCNEWEwJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The powerful story of love and loss that inspired the creation of Shakespeare's timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":840430,\"title\":\"The Holdovers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/VHSzNBTwxV8vh7wylo7O9CLdac.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/57fhbxl9is7W7ur5v6UuvlNsoSg.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A curmudgeonly instructor at a New England prep school is forced to remain on campus during Christmas break to babysit the handful of students with nowhere to go. Eventually, he forms an unlikely bond with one of them — a damaged, brainy troublemaker — and with the school’s head cook, who has just lost a son in Vietnam.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1497463,\"title\":\"All That We Never Were\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sibLxfckIiI821iG00YpXopY4LG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/liVDJBzSplrboMCykKydhaaR215.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"19-year-old Leah navigates a coming-of-age journey in the wake of a tragic car accident that claims her parents. Relocated to a coastal town under the care of her brother’s best friend Axel, Leah grapples with grief, haunting nightmares and a fractured sense of self.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":747188,\"title\":\"Asteroid City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hfo7pvL9Fys7rocfL4VOzw9qDEQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dExUxMWt0UjS93waeCGYeDr1D7m.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In an American desert town circa 1955, the itinerary of a Junior Stargazer/Space Cadet convention is spectacularly disrupted by world-changing events.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":758866,\"title\":\"Drive My Car\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/znXps7wPyYq8UDCfeyO2vfEIeRS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r6aqhlmJmu8Dv5E7QYEruaEXKYm.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Yusuke Kafuku, a stage actor and director, still unable, after two years, to cope with the loss of his beloved wife, accepts to direct Uncle Vanya at a theater festival in Hiroshima. There he meets Misaki, an introverted young woman, appointed to drive his car. In between rides, secrets from the past and heartfelt confessions will be unveiled.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1000837,\"title\":\"I'm Still Here\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gZnsMbhCvhzAQlKaVpeFRHYjGyb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j9uruwRe9qM8RnP758dF7ISB8Bj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A woman married to a former politician during the 1971 military dictatorship in Brazil is forced to reinvent herself and chart a new course for her family after a violent and arbitrary act.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":616747,\"title\":\"Haunted Mansion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Im6DknDVxRiGXc5t8rVOJyzuNx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Als2QyqbLgT5G3rwTGJta8QQfqP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A woman and her son enlist a motley crew of so-called spiritual experts to help rid their home of supernatural squatters.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10740,\"title\":\"Birth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z70iQ61WqhxETAz8ar2oD8pkIM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ueXO7FqIECtcPbpPSw87hiFlrSA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It took Anna 10 years to recover from the death of her husband, Sean, but now she's on the verge of marrying her boyfriend, Joseph, and finally moving on. However, on the night of her engagement party, a young boy named Sean turns up, saying he is her dead husband reincarnated. At first she ignores the child, but his knowledge of her former husband's life is uncanny, leading her to believe that he might be telling the truth.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"YRi88fA_Khk\",\"name\"